{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1789176550118,"sessionID":"ses_f6cc629c4ffeGQkDWkJQ3TMMRE","part":{"id":"prt_0933b92e400163lsucjTnGggi9","messageID":"msg_0933b8a6a001aazjQJatbKytRs","sessionID":"ses_f6cc629c4ffeGQkDWkJQ3TMMRE","snapshot":"fa84a9627a225c1941c31804b4ff49d2cc38a23f","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1789176552774,"sessionID":"ses_f6cc629c4ffeGQkDWkJQ3TMMRE","part":{"id":"prt_0933b947a0015LxsJbxiu29pgx","messageID":"msg_0933b8a6a001aazjQJatbKytRs","sessionID":"ses_f6cc629c4ffeGQkDWkJQ3TMMRE","type":"text","text":"Project reads lack a membership check, and updates reuse that unchecked read. List authorization already runs before cache lookup, but the cache key omits the organization and updates don’t invalidate lists. I’ll fix those paths and add regression tests for denied access, organization switching, and targeted invalidation.\n","time":{"start":1789176550522,"end":1789176552771},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_00260f329e857a34016aa4aae6734c87d1aba0a739d093fd87","phase":"commentary"}}}}
